      "message": "The specification never uses the agent certificate\u0027s private key in any part of the SPAKE2 computation.   The Agent Fingerprint is used as input to M and N.\n\n- It looks like the terminology in the RFC has shifted again.  What used to be called A and B is now M and N it seems.",
