      "side": 1,
      "message": "I would normally expect one instance of this class to exist each time the authentication protocol is run and to be destroyed once authentication is complete.   In fact, using the same object for multiple agents runs the risk of mixing data between authentication sessions, which we don\u0027t want.\n\nPassing the instance_id once in the constructor and using it once instead of to each method would make this API simpler.",
